    {
      "create_time": 1761818487,
      "formatted_time": "2025-10-30 18:01:27",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "🔹Case Prompt: \nNorth Sun, a Japanese leading manufacturer of electric passenger vehicles, has been struggling with a low market share in the B2B segment. North Sun enjoys strong positions in the B2C space, both domestically and in the international market. However, North Sun's sales to small and medium size businesses continue staying far below expectations. The CEO has invited you to help them out.\n\n🔹中文题目：\nNorth Sun，一家日本领先的电动乘用车制造商，一直在企业对企业细分市场中苦于市场份额偏低的问题。North Sun在B2C（企业对消费者）领域享有强势地位，无论是在国内市场还是国际市场都是如此。然而，North Sun对中小型企业的销售一直远低于预期。CEO邀请你来帮助他们解决这个问题。",
      "sender_name": "K学姐",
      "sender_wxid": "wxid_gci3yscatvzm12"
    },
    {
      "create_time": 1761818547,
      "formatted_time": "2025-10-30 18:02:27",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "🌟Additional Information:\n\n1️⃣North Sun accounts for 65% of all Japanese battery-electric vehicles sold\n2️⃣Japanese cars capture 5% of pure electric vehicles sold worldwide\n3️⃣The e-vehicle global market size is projected to grow from 4M units in 2021 to 35M units by 2030 (27% CAGR)\n4️⃣Rental car firms, corporations and government agencies (e.g. police) are among major B2B client groups for electric cars\n5️⃣North Sun's model range of electric vehicles includes only passenger cars (not buses or trucks)\n6️⃣There is no specific revenue goal",
      "sender_name": "K学姐",
      "sender_wxid": "wxid_gci3yscatvzm12"
    },
    {
      "create_time": 1761818579,
      "formatted_time": "2025-10-30 18:02:59",
      "type": "文本消息",
      "str_content": "附加信息：\n1️⃣North Sun占据了本国所有售出的日本纯电动汽车的65%份额\n2️⃣日本汽车占据全球纯电动汽车销量的5%\n3️⃣电动汽车全球市场规模预计将从2021年的400万辆增长到2030年的3500万辆（年复合增长率27%）\n4️⃣租车公司、企业和政府机构（例如警察部门）是电动汽车的主要企业对企业客户群体\n5️⃣North Sun的电动汽车产品系列仅包括乘用车（不包括公交车或卡车）\n6️⃣没有具体的收入目标",
      "sender_name": "K学姐",
